WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.381 --> 00:00:02.856
- She's a British entrepreneur and leader.

00:00:02.856 --> 00:00:05.307
She co-founded the
lingerie company, Ultimo,

00:00:05.307 --> 00:00:07.633
and the fake tanning company, UTan.

00:00:07.633 --> 00:00:10.929
She has an estimated net
worth of 60 million dollars.

00:00:10.929 --> 00:00:12.581
She's Michelle Mone, and here are her

00:00:12.581 --> 00:00:14.554
top 10 rules for success.

00:00:14.554 --> 00:00:16.637
(swoosh)

00:00:17.516 --> 00:00:21.360
- I think that I watched all
my friends' moms and dads

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:23.688
getting made redundant and I thought,

00:00:23.688 --> 00:00:26.551
I want to be in charge
of a company and I want

00:00:26.551 --> 00:00:29.456
to make people's lives
happy instead of always

00:00:29.456 --> 00:00:30.879
make them worry at Christmas time.

00:00:30.879 --> 00:00:33.681
"Am I going to have a job
to buy toys for my kids?"

00:00:33.681 --> 00:00:38.104
And I thought, it doesn't matter,

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:39.115
if you're born

00:00:39.115 --> 00:00:42.161
into royalty or you're born into money,

00:00:42.161 --> 00:00:46.967
I'm going to show people that
someone from the East End

00:00:46.967 --> 00:00:49.941
who hasn't done well at school
can still make something

00:00:49.941 --> 00:00:51.477
of their lives.

00:00:51.477 --> 00:00:55.092
It doesn't mean to say East End of Glasgow

00:00:55.092 --> 00:00:58.668
that you're going to be a drug
dealer, and you're going to be just

00:00:58.668 --> 00:01:00.571
no good at anything.

00:01:00.571 --> 00:01:04.614
I wanted to show people
that we're all human beings

00:01:04.614 --> 00:01:06.475
and it doesn't matter where we're born,

00:01:06.475 --> 00:01:08.856
where we're brought up, how much money

00:01:08.856 --> 00:01:11.506
your families have got,
you can make something

00:01:11.506 --> 00:01:14.346
of your life because you're
in charge of your life.

00:01:14.346 --> 00:01:16.869
And I think that's what drives me.

00:01:16.869 --> 00:01:20.232
I just think that my mom
and dad brought me up

00:01:20.232 --> 00:01:23.107
and taught me to have respect for anyone,

00:01:23.107 --> 00:01:26.317
no matter if you're the queen,
or you're emptying the bins,

00:01:26.317 --> 00:01:28.068
and everyone is special.

00:01:28.068 --> 00:01:31.156
And I think that just
appreciate life and never think

00:01:31.156 --> 00:01:34.153
in negative ways because
negative things will happen.

00:01:34.153 --> 00:01:37.011
If you want to achieve
something, write down your goals

00:01:37.011 --> 00:01:40.226
and if it doesn't work
out, it's your own fault.

00:01:40.226 --> 00:01:41.059
And do it!

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:45.080
You've got to do something
that makes you passionate,

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:48.013
that makes you tick, that makes
you get yup in the morning,

00:01:48.013 --> 00:01:50.993
that makes you get two hours
sleep at night if you have to,

00:01:50.993 --> 00:01:52.697
like I did last night.

00:01:52.697 --> 00:01:55.722
But to make sure that
you're doing something

00:01:55.722 --> 00:01:59.520
because you only live
once and you will know

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:03.098
what makes you happy
inside and go with that,

00:02:03.098 --> 00:02:06.542
and then it's a case of
you've got to put whatever in

00:02:06.542 --> 00:02:08.959
that it takes to get it done.

00:02:09.984 --> 00:02:12.138
My mom and dad always taught
me when I was growing up

00:02:12.138 --> 00:02:16.123
that you treat people that
how you want treated yourself

00:02:16.123 --> 00:02:19.708
and I think that's the best
thing that they ever taught me

00:02:19.708 --> 00:02:23.875
because I never treat people
people badly and unfairly.

00:02:24.894 --> 00:02:29.254
I always treat them with respect

00:02:29.254 --> 00:02:30.799
and I think that's how I've got

00:02:30.799 --> 00:02:33.633
such a fantastic team round about me.

00:02:33.633 --> 00:02:35.982
They really are all
enthusiastic and determined.

00:02:35.982 --> 00:02:38.723
If you've got that idea, it's all about

00:02:38.723 --> 00:02:40.492
believing in yourself.

00:02:40.492 --> 00:02:42.765
First of all if you've got the confidence

00:02:42.765 --> 00:02:46.421
and you believe it and
you know in your heart,

00:02:46.421 --> 00:02:49.476
I can do this, that's all it really takes.

00:02:49.476 --> 00:02:52.135
Then the other things
come, the business plan,

00:02:52.135 --> 00:02:54.789
the financing of it, the
idea, where you're going

00:02:54.789 --> 00:02:57.491
to manufacture, or if
it's a service that you're

00:02:57.491 --> 00:02:58.559
going to provide.

00:02:58.559 --> 00:03:01.226
All of these things come
but first of all you've got

00:03:01.226 --> 00:03:02.833
to believe in yourself.

00:03:02.833 --> 00:03:04.505
You've got to want to do it.

00:03:04.505 --> 00:03:07.733
If you don't want to do
it, don't even start it.

00:03:07.733 --> 00:03:10.028
You've got to go it and
you've got to approach people.

00:03:10.028 --> 00:03:12.651
Don't ever sit there and wait
for someone to come to you

00:03:12.651 --> 00:03:14.665
because I tell you it will never happen.

00:03:14.665 --> 00:03:16.690
You've got to look for
your own opportunities

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:19.846
and you've got to say
this is what I want to do,

00:03:19.846 --> 00:03:23.321
therefore who's your customers,
what markets you want

00:03:23.321 --> 00:03:25.068
to go into, who's your competitors,

00:03:25.068 --> 00:03:28.870
write down a really strong
business plan as well.

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:31.696
What keeps my feet firmly on the ground,

00:03:31.696 --> 00:03:34.544
I have it back in my mind
I could lose all tomorrow

00:03:34.544 --> 00:03:38.363
and you never get too big for your boots

00:03:38.363 --> 00:03:41.394
and I'm doing this not just for my family

00:03:41.394 --> 00:03:43.633
but I'm doing it to help others as well

00:03:43.633 --> 00:03:48.206
because I want to help people
who are not so fortunate

00:03:48.206 --> 00:03:51.442
as I am in the places
that I was brought up in,

00:03:51.442 --> 00:03:53.743
because I know what poverty is.

00:03:53.743 --> 00:03:57.158
I've been at one end of
the stick to the other.

00:03:57.158 --> 00:03:59.370
I've been there where
you don't have any money

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:01.697
and you don't have a
bath and the rest of it,

00:04:01.697 --> 00:04:04.548
and I've been partying on
boats with Richard Branson

00:04:04.548 --> 00:04:07.314
and famous singers and actresses

00:04:07.314 --> 00:04:11.481
and so you know, i know
what both sides of life are

00:04:12.693 --> 00:04:15.882
and I just want to help
others as much as I can.

00:04:15.882 --> 00:04:18.668
I think you know, I've
always thought this way,

00:04:18.668 --> 00:04:20.295
fail to plan, plan to fail.

00:04:20.295 --> 00:04:23.961
I'm always a planner, I always
create lists, I always carry

00:04:23.961 --> 00:04:27.521
a book in my bag, what I need
to do today, both personally

00:04:27.521 --> 00:04:29.477
and both in business.

00:04:29.477 --> 00:04:32.252
And I stay focused on that list and I try

00:04:32.252 --> 00:04:36.721
and tick every single
bit off and if I don't

00:04:36.721 --> 00:04:39.594
I'm not Superwoman,
I've got three children,

00:04:39.594 --> 00:04:43.344
I'm not the best business
woman on the planet

00:04:45.028 --> 00:04:47.588
but I just try my best
and if I don't manage

00:04:47.588 --> 00:04:50.055
to do everything on the
list then I take it forward

00:04:50.055 --> 00:04:51.125
to the next day.

00:04:51.125 --> 00:04:55.741
I fight every single day of
business, I'm so determined.

00:04:55.741 --> 00:04:59.367
I start new ideas every single week.

00:04:59.367 --> 00:05:03.177
And I think what drives
me, don't get me wrong,

00:05:03.177 --> 00:05:06.774
money used to drive me
but then when you pass by

00:05:06.774 --> 00:05:10.545
some of these goals that
you achieve, it is on

00:05:10.545 --> 00:05:14.993
to another level and
it's weird to explain it,

00:05:14.993 --> 00:05:18.838
it's hard to explain it but I
think it's a fear of failure

00:05:18.838 --> 00:05:23.683
that keeps me going and always
want to make a difference

00:05:23.683 --> 00:05:26.706
for my customers, always want
to give them the best fit,

00:05:26.706 --> 00:05:30.904
the best quality and I've
just started up Ultimo Beauty,

00:05:30.904 --> 00:05:34.815
Ultimo UTan, worked on
new tanning products,

00:05:34.815 --> 00:05:39.092
no streaks, no smell, it's
launched in Booth's, Debenhams,

00:05:39.092 --> 00:05:41.112
House of Fraser, Harvey Nichols, Harrods,

00:05:41.112 --> 00:05:45.521
it's launched all over and
I just love the challenge

00:05:45.521 --> 00:05:50.073
and try and keep it real.

00:05:50.073 --> 00:05:51.688
I do my best to keep it real.

00:05:51.688 --> 00:05:54.435
Because you know what,
there are other bigger boats

00:05:54.435 --> 00:05:57.431
in the sea, much bigger than me.

00:05:57.431 --> 00:06:01.264
And I still believe that
I've not made it yet.

00:06:02.145 --> 00:06:04.455
I don't believe I've made it yet.

00:06:04.455 --> 00:06:08.783
I always had a dream and my
dream was to be big in business.

00:06:08.783 --> 00:06:11.336
And I always, always believe
that it doesn't matter

00:06:11.336 --> 00:06:13.158
where you're from, it doesn't matter

00:06:13.158 --> 00:06:17.388
what background you have,
it doesn't matter education.

00:06:17.388 --> 00:06:19.224
You've got to try your best.

00:06:19.224 --> 00:06:22.644
But my situation it wasn't for me.

00:06:22.644 --> 00:06:24.750
When I left school at 15 with a dream,

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:26.774
and I always, always think big.

00:06:26.774 --> 00:06:28.861
You should always think big in life.

00:06:28.861 --> 00:06:31.080
Never ever think that
you can't make it because

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:32.698
others out there are better than you.

00:06:32.698 --> 00:06:34.956
You're just as good as anyone else.

00:06:34.956 --> 00:06:36.345
- Thank you so much for watching.

00:06:36.345 --> 00:06:39.821
I made this video because
Twiggy Monae asked me to.

00:06:39.821 --> 00:06:41.896
So if there's a famous
entrepreneur that you

00:06:41.896 --> 00:06:44.640
want me to profile next,
leave it in the comments below

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:45.863
and I'll see what I can do.

00:06:45.863 --> 00:06:48.628
I'd also love to know which
of Michelle's top 10 rules

00:06:48.628 --> 00:06:50.533
had the biggest impact on you.

00:06:50.533 --> 00:06:53.064
Leave it in the comments and
I will join the discussion.

00:06:53.064 --> 00:06:55.268
Thank you so much for
watching, continue to believe

00:06:55.268 --> 00:06:57.343
and I'll see yous soon.

00:06:57.343 --> 00:06:59.426
(swoosh)

